   "id": 493910,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Using set builder notation, write the set <span data-math=\"C\">C</span> of all types of cars.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The roster method lists the elements of the set. Set builder notation uses a letter to represent a sample member of the set, a vertical bar, and then a description of a sample member. In this case, because it is not practical to list all types of cars, it is much easier to use set builder notation.</p>\n<span data-math=\"C = \\left\\{ {c|c\\,\\,{\\rm{is\\ a\\ type\\ of\\ car}}} \\right\\}\"></span>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"C = \\{c|c{\\text{ }}{\\text{is a car}}\\}\">C = \\{c|c{\\text{ }}{\\text{is a car}}\\}</span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
